<BaseLayout title="Terms & Conditions" description="Terms and conditions for purchasing from Cybex Precision Gunworx.">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Terms & Conditions</span></div>
      <h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Agreement to Terms</h2>
        <p>By placing an order with Cybex Precision Gunworx ("CPG," "we," "us"), you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions. Please read them carefully before making a purchase.</p>

        <h2>Age Requirements</h2>
        <p>You must be at least 21 years old to use this site and to purchase handguns or pistol uppers. The legal minimum for long guns is 18 where permitted by law. We may require proof of age and may cancel any order if eligibility cannot be verified.</p>

        <h2>Legal Eligibility</h2>
        <p>By ordering you represent that you are not prohibited from purchasing or possessing firearms under federal, state or local law (including 18 U.S.C. § 922), that you are buying for yourself and not as a straw purchaser, and that the items are legal where you live and where your receiving FFL is located. All firearm transfers require a completed ATF Form 4473 and background check at the FFL.</p>

        <h2>FFL Transfer Requirement</h2>
        <p>All complete firearms and serialized lower receivers ship only to a licensed Federal Firearms Licensee (FFL) who has provided us a valid license copy. It is your responsibility to ensure your selected FFL can legally receive the item(s) you purchase. See our <a href="/policies/shipping/">Shipping Policy</a>.</p>

        <h2>Restricted States</h2>
        <p>We do not ship firearms, receivers or uppers to the locations listed on our <a href="/policies/restricted-states/">Restricted States</a> page. We may cancel and refund any order we believe violates law or this policy.</p>

        <h2>Sales Final on Firearms</h2>
        <p>Firearm and custom-build sales are final. See our <a href="/policies/returns/">Return Policy</a> for defects, warranty and denied-transfer handling.</p>

        <h2>Compliance</h2>
        <p>CPG will not ship any product that violates federal, state, or local laws. It is the buyer's responsibility to know and comply with all applicable firearms laws in their jurisdiction.</p>

        <h2>California Proposition 65</h2>
        <p><strong>WARNING: Cancer and Reproductive Harm – <a href="https://www.p65warnings.ca.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.P65Warnings.ca.gov</a></strong></p>

        <h2>Pricing & Availability</h2>
        <p>All prices are in USD and are subject to change without notice. We reserve the right to limit quantities and to refuse any order. Product availability is not guaranteed until your order is confirmed and payment is processed.</p>

        <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>CPG is not liable for any damages resulting from the misuse, modification, or improper maintenance of any product purchased from us. Our liability is limited to the purchase price of the product.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms? Contact us at <a href="mailto:sales@cybexprecisiongunworx.com">sales@cybexprecisiongunworx.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
